            "question_count": 10,
            "content": "<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 710px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.8632%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 710px;\">\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 710px;\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Conflict at work</strong></h4>\n<p>Conflict mostly consists of behaviour in the general category of <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_31\">______</span>.</p>\n<p>Often a result of people wanting to prove their <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_32\">______</span></p>\n<p>Also caused by differences in <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_33\">______</span> between people &lsquo;<span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_34\">______</span>&rsquo; conflicts: people more concerned about own team than about company</p>\n<p>Conflict-related stress can cause <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_35\">______</span> that may last for months</p>\n<p><strong>Chief Executives (CEOs)</strong></p>\n<p>Many have both <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_36\">______</span> and anxiety</p>\n<p>May not like to have their decisions questioned</p>\n<p>There may be conflict between people who have different <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_37\">______</span></p>\n<p><strong>Other managers</strong></p>\n<p>A structure that is more <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_38\">______</span> may create a feeling of uncertainly about who staff should report to.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimising conflict</strong></p>\n<p>Bosses need to try hard to gain <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_39\">______</span></p>\n<p>Someone from outside the company may be given the role of <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_40\">______</span> in order to resolve conflicts.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
